{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-parallel-search","title":"分布式并行搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/distributed-parallel-search","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式并行搜索\">分布式并行搜索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>批量建议</strong>：q-EI、Constant Liar 和 Thompson Sampling 在无结果反馈时生成多个有差异性候选点</li>\n<li><strong>多级并行架构</strong>：多线程 → 多进程（JournalStorage）→ 多节点（GrpcStorageProxy/Ray）的递进扩展</li>\n<li><strong>异步 vs 同步</strong>：异步并行消除&quot;木桶效应&quot;实现近 100% 集群利用率，是生产环境标准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"并行化的必要性与挑战\">并行化的必要性与挑战</h2><p>单机串行贝叶斯优化每次只评估一个配置，墙钟时间 = 试验数 × 单次评估时间。当单次训练需要数小时且可用 GPU 集群有数十张卡时，串行利用率极低。并行搜索的目标是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 worker 同时评估不同配置，将墙钟时间压缩约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍——但挑战在于：贝叶斯优化本质上是序贯决策过程，&quot;建议下一个点&quot;依赖于&quot;上一个点的结果&quot;。</p>\n<p>并行搜索需要解答两个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>批量建议</strong>：如何在尚未获得当前 batch 结果时生成多个有差异性的候选点</li>\n<li><strong>分布式协调</strong>：多进程/多节点如何共享观测数据和模型状态</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"批量建议策略\">批量建议策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>多样性保证</th>\n<th>计算代价</th>\n<th>工具支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>q-EI（联合）</td>\n<td>直接优化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 点的联合期望改进</td>\n<td>数学最优</td>\n<td>高（MC 采样）</td>\n<td>BoTorch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Constant Liar</td>\n<td>串行 EI + 虚拟值填充</td>\n<td>依赖 liar 值选择</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Optuna</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Local Penalization</td>\n<td>EI × 惩罚已选点附近区域</td>\n<td>几何排斥</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Thompson Sampling</td>\n<td>独立后验采样，各取最优</td>\n<td>天然高多样性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Optuna/BoTorch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kriging Believer</td>\n<td>串行 EI + 预测均值填充</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>SMAC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>q-EI 的蒙特卡洛近似</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个点联合采样目标值的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>MC</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{MC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条路径，在每条路径上计算改进量并取平均。BoTorch 通过可微的 MC 采样 + 自动微分优化整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 点集合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>q-EI</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><munderover><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>q</mi></munderover><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{q-EI}(\\mathbf{x}_1, \\dots, \\mathbf{x}_q) = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{j=1}^N \\max\\left(f^* - \\min_{i=1}^q \\tilde{f}_j(\\mathbf{x}_i), 0\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">q-EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2421em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3164em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.915em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Constant Liar 的三种变体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>cl_min</code>：假设正在运行的 trial 结果等于当前最优值——偏利用</li>\n<li><code>cl_mean</code>：假设结果等于当前均值——平衡</li>\n<li><code>cl_max</code>：假设结果等于当前最差值——偏探索</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Optuna 默认使用 <code>cl_mean</code>（<code>TPESampler(constant_liar=True)</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"optuna-的多级并行架构\">Optuna 的多级并行架构</h2><p>Optuna 4.9 支持三层并行粒度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 多线程 n_jobs&#10;        A[Study.optimize&lt;br/&gt;n_jobs=4] --&gt; B[Thread Pool&lt;br/&gt;4 线程]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 多进程 JournalStorage&#10;        C[进程 1&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D[(JournalStorage&lt;br/&gt;文件锁同步)]&#10;        E[进程 2&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D&#10;        F[进程 3&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 多节点 GrpcStorageProxy&#10;        G[节点 A&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H[GrpcStorageProxy&lt;br/&gt;高性能 RPC]&#10;        I[节点 B&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H&#10;        J[节点 C&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H&#10;        H --&gt; K[(中心 Storage&lt;br/&gt;RDB/Journal)]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 多线程 n_jobs\n        A[Study.optimize&lt;br/&gt;n_jobs=4] --&gt; B[Thread Pool&lt;br/&gt;4 线程]\n    end\n    subgraph 多进程 JournalStorage\n        C[进程 1&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D[(JournalStorage&lt;br/&gt;文件锁同步)]\n        E[进程 2&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D\n        F[进程 3&lt;br/&gt;study.optimize] --&gt; D\n    end\n    subgraph 多节点 GrpcStorageProxy\n        G[节点 A&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H[GrpcStorageProxy&lt;br/&gt;高性能 RPC]\n        I[节点 B&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H\n        J[节点 C&lt;br/&gt;Worker] --&gt; H\n        H --&gt; K[(中心 Storage&lt;br/&gt;RDB/Journal)]\n    end</pre><p><strong>多线程</strong>（<code>n_jobs &gt; 1</code>）：最简单的并行——多线程共享内存中的 Study 对象。Python GIL 限制了真正的并行计算，但如果 objective 函数内部释放 GIL（如调用 C 扩展/GPU 计算），仍然有效。Python 3.14 移除 GIL 后此模式将更高效。</p>\n<p><strong>多进程</strong>（<code>JournalStorage</code>）：每个进程独立运行 <code>study.optimize()</code>，通过共享的 JournalStorage（基于文件追加写 + 文件锁）或 RDBStorage（基于 PostgreSQL/MySQL）同步 trial 状态。每个进程在 suggest 前读取最新数据，确保 TPE 模型基于全局信息建议。</p>\n<p><strong>多节点</strong>（<code>GrpcStorageProxy</code>，v4.5+ 新增）：在 master 节点运行 gRPC 存储代理，worker 节点通过网络连接。解决了 RDB 在数千 worker 时的连接数瓶颈。Optuna 官方文档表示此架构可扩展到数千节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ax-与-ray-tune-的分布式架构\">Ax 与 Ray Tune 的分布式架构</h2><p><strong>Ax Scheduler</strong>：Ax 的 <code>Scheduler</code> 组件管理 trial 的全生命周期——生成、部署、轮询、完成。配合 <code>Runner</code>（执行后端）可对接 Kubernetes、Slurm 或云平台：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ax.service.scheduler import Scheduler&#10;&#10;scheduler = Scheduler(&#10;    experiment=experiment,&#10;    generation_strategy=generation_strategy,&#10;    options=SchedulerOptions(&#10;        max_pending_trials=10,      # 最大并行 trial 数&#10;        trial_type=TrialType.TRIAL, # 单次 vs BatchTrial&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;scheduler.run_all_trials()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ax.service.scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Scheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Scheduler(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    experiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">experiment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    generation_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">generation_strategy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SchedulerOptions(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_pending_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最大并行 trial 数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        trial_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TrialType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TRIAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单次 vs BatchTrial</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler.run_all_trials()</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Ray Tune 的资源感知调度</strong>：Ray Tune 将每个 trial 视为一个 Ray Actor，资源（CPU/GPU/内存）在集群中自动分配。<code>tune.with_resources</code> 控制每个 trial 的资源需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ray import tune&#10;&#10;tuner = tune.Tuner(&#10;    tune.with_resources(train_fn, {&quot;gpu&quot;: 1, &quot;cpu&quot;: 4}),&#10;    tune_config=tune.TuneConfig(&#10;        num_samples=100,&#10;        max_concurrent_trials=8,&#10;        scheduler=ASHAScheduler(...)&#10;    )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tune</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tuner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tune.Tuner(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tune.with_resources(train_fn, {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cpu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tune_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tune.TuneConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        num_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_concurrent_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        scheduler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ASHAScheduler(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"异步-vs-同步并行\">异步 vs 同步并行</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>同步并行</th>\n<th>异步并行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等待策略</td>\n<td>等一个 batch 全部完成再建议下一 batch</td>\n<td>任一 trial 完成立即建议新 trial</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群利用率</td>\n<td>受最慢 trial 限制（&quot;木桶效应&quot;）</td>\n<td>近 100%（无空闲 worker）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型更新频率</td>\n<td>每 batch 一次</td>\n<td>每个 trial 完成一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议质量</td>\n<td>每批内用 q-EI 最优</td>\n<td>需要处理 pending trial</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需处理竞态条件）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产环境几乎总是选择异步并行——trial 评估时间的方差（由不同配置的收敛速度、早停行为等导致）使得同步模式效率极低。ASHA 天然是异步的——这是它在 Ray Tune 中作为默认调度器的重要原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通信开销与带宽\">通信开销与带宽</h2><p>分布式搜索的开销来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Trial 状态同步</strong>：每个 trial 完成后需要将结果写入共享存储</li>\n<li><strong>模型更新广播</strong>：代理模型需要在新数据到达后重拟合</li>\n<li><strong>采集函数优化</strong>：在 master 节点执行</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对 GP-based 方法，模型拟合是瓶颈：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Cholesky 分解在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 时可能需要数秒。如果 trial 评估本身很短（如小模型数分钟完成），模型拟合延迟反而成为墙钟瓶颈。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用稀疏 GP（降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nm^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\ll n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>不每次都重拟合核超参数（每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次 trial 做一次完整优化）</li>\n<li>TPE 无此问题——密度估计是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"容错与断点续传\">容错与断点续传</h2><p>分布式系统中 trial 失败是常态而非异常（OOM、节点掉线、超时）。HPO 系统必须优雅处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Optuna</strong>：failed trial 标记为 <code>FAIL</code> 状态，不参与模型拟合。<code>study.optimize(catch=(Exception,))</code> 避免单个 trial 失败中断整个 study。</li>\n<li><strong>Ax</strong>：<code>Scheduler</code> 内置重试逻辑（<code>max_retries</code>）和失败 trial 处理策略。</li>\n<li><strong>Ray Tune</strong>：<code>failure_config</code> 控制失败 trial 的重新调度。支持从 checkpoint 恢复被抢占的 trial。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>断点续传是长时间搜索的关键需求——Optuna 的所有 Storage 后端天然支持（再次 <code>create_study(study_name=..., load_if_exists=True)</code> 即可续传），Ax 通过 JSON/SQL 序列化 Experiment 支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩展性边界\">扩展性边界</h2><p>贝叶斯优化的并行效率有理论上限：当并行度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 GP 模型中被观测点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 时，每 batch 的信息增益递减（因为 batch 内的点互相提供的新信息有限）。经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\leq 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>：接近线性加速</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 &lt; k \\leq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>：亚线性但仍有显著收益</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &gt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>：边际收益极小，考虑混合策略（部分随机 + 部分模型指导）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于大规模并行（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &gt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>），混合策略更实际：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个 trial 用 Sobol/LHS 随机并行（最大化空间覆盖）</li>\n<li>中期用 BO 指导 + Thompson Sampling 保证多样性</li>\n<li>后期缩小信赖域做局部精细搜索</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"../practice/optuna-ax-platform\">Optuna 与 Ax 平台</a>提供了这些策略的具体配置方式和生产级部署模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分布式并行搜索将贝叶斯优化从单机串行推向集群规模。批量建议策略（q-EI、Constant Liar、Thompson Sampling）解决&quot;无结果时如何建议多点&quot;的核心问题。Optuna 的 GrpcStorageProxy 和 Ax 的 Scheduler + Runner 提供了生产级的多节点协调。异步并行是实际部署的标准选择——ASHA 天然异步是其在 Ray Tune 中作为默认调度器的重要原因。并行效率在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &gt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 时递减，需要混合策略（随机 + 模型指导）保持收益。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式并行搜索","id":"分布式并行搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"并行化的必要性与挑战","id":"并行化的必要性与挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"批量建议策略","id":"批量建议策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Optuna 的多级并行架构","id":"optuna-的多级并行架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Ax 与 Ray Tune 的分布式架构","id":"ax-与-ray-tune-的分布式架构"},{"level":2,"text":"异步 vs 同步并行","id":"异步-vs-同步并行"},{"level":2,"text":"通信开销与带宽","id":"通信开销与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"容错与断点续传","id":"容错与断点续传"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展性边界","id":"扩展性边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"早停与调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"Optuna 与 Ax 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/optuna-ax-platform"}}